ell 元字符的 URL\n- 验证 URL 格式（必须以 `http://` 或 `https://` 开头）\n- 在被要求时通过 `skill_log` 记录解析失败（可选，仅在调用者设置 `SKILL_TAG` 时）\n\n```\n_load_backend_url() {\n  if [ -n \"$BACKEND_URL\" ]; then\n    return 0\n  fi\n  local conf_file=\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/backend.conf\"\n  [ -f \"$conf_file\" ] || return 1\n\n  local raw_url\n  raw_url=$(grep '^BACKEND_URL=' \"$conf_file\" 2>/dev/null | head -1 | cut -d= -f2-)\n  [ -z \"$raw_url\" ] && return 1\n\n  # Basic validation: must start with http:// or https://, no whitespace/newlines\n  case \"$raw_url\" in\n    http://*|https://*) ;;\n    *) \n      [ -n \"$SKILL_TAG\" ] && skill_log \"WARN\" \"backend.conf: invalid URL format: $raw_url\"\n      return 1\n      ;;\n  esac\n\n  # Reject URLs containing whitespace\n  case \"$raw_url\" in\n    *\\ *|*\\\t*|*$'\\n'*)\n      [ -n \"$SKILL_TAG\" ] && skill_log \"WARN\" \"backend.conf: URL contains whitespace\"\n      return 1\n      ;;\n  esac\n\n  BACKEND_URL=\"$raw_url\"\n}\n```\n\n**B. 添加一个新的 `_require_backend()` 函数。**\n\n这是 claim-blocking 机制。当后端必须可用以进行安全操作（claim）时，调用者会使用它。\n\n```\n# Returns 0 if backend is available, 1 otherwise.\n# Logs the unavailability if SKILL_TAG is set.\n# Use this before claim operations that MUST NOT proceed without backend.\n_require_backend() {\n  _load_backend_url\n  if [ -z \"$BACKEND_URL\" ]; then\n    # No backend configured at all -- this is fine, skip backend calls\n    return 2  # Special code: \"not configured\" vs \"unavailable\"\n  fi\n  if curl -s --max-time 2 \"$BACKEND_URL/health\" > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n    return 0\n  fi\n  # Backend configured but unreachable\n  [ -n \"$SKILL_TAG\" ] && skill_log \"WARN\" \"Backend unreachable at $BACKEND_URL\"\n  return 1\n}\n```\n\n返回码：\n- 0：后端可用\n- 1：后端已配置但不可达（用于 claim 的阻塞条件）\n- 2：完全未配置后端（对于 claim 绕过是安全的）\n\n**C. 更新 `_call_backend()` 以添加可选日志记录。**\n\n```\n_call_backend() {\n  local endpoint=\"$1\"\n  local data=\"$2\"\n  _load_backend_url\n  [ -z \"$BACKEND_URL\" ] && return 1\n\n  local resp\n  resp=$(curl -s --max-time 5 -X POST \"$BACKEND_URL$endpoint\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"$data\" 2>/dev/null)\n  local rc=$?\n  if [ $rc -ne 0 ]; then\n    [ -n \"$SKILL_TAG\" ] && skill_log \"DEBUG\" \"Backend call failed: $endpoint (curl rc=$rc)\"\n    return 1\n  fi\n  [ -n \"$resp\" ] && echo \"$resp\"\n}\n```\n\n**D. 更新 `_backend_available()` 以便也记录日志。**\n\n无需功能更改——它已经正常运行。只需为调试添加一个可选的日志行。\n\n---\n\n#### 阶段 2：更新技能脚本\n\n**文件：** `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-4-issue-claim\\scripts\\03UserPromptSubmit.sh`\n\n这是关键的更改。`claim_issue_backend()` 函数必须阻止后端已配置但不可达的 claim。\n\n在 `03UserPromptSubmit.sh` 的当前第 41-72 行中的 `claim_issue_backend()` 函数中，替换：\n\n```\nclaim_issue_backend() {\n  local issue_num=\"$1\"\n  local issue_title=\"$2\"\n\n  _load_backend_url\n  [ -z \"$BACKEND_URL\" ] && return 0   # No backend configured, skip\n\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n为：\n\n```\nclaim_issue_backend() {\n  local issue_num=\"$1\"\n  local issue_title=\"$2\"\n\n  _load_backend_url\n  [ -z \"$BACKEND_URL\" ] && return 0   # No backend configured, skip\n\n  local session_id\n  session_id=$(_get_session_id)\n  [ -z \"$session_id\" ] && return 0\n\n  local repo\n  repo=$(_get_repo)\n  [ -z \"$repo\" ] && return 0\n\n  # Backend is configured -- verify it is reachable before attempting claim\n  if ! _backend_available; then\n    skill_log \"ERROR\" \"Backend configured but unreachable -- BLOCKING claim for #$issue_num\"\n    echo \"ERROR: Backend server is unreachable. Cannot safely claim issue #$issue_num (risk of multi-agent conflict).\"\n    echo \"Please ensure the backend is running at $BACKEND_URL and try again.\"\n    return 1\n  fi\n\n  local result\n  result=$(_call_backend \"/api/issue/claim\" \"{\n    \\\"repo_full_name\\\":\\\"$repo\\\",\n    \\\"issue_number\\\":$issue_num,\n    \\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$session_id\\\",\n    \\\"issue_title\\\":\\\"$issue_title\\\"\n  }\")\n\n  if [ -z \"$result\" ]; then\n    skill_log \"ERROR\" \"Backend claim call returned empty for #$issue_num\"\n    echo \"ERROR: Backend claim call failed unexpectedly for issue #$issue_num.\"\n    return 1\n  fi\n\n  if ! echo \"$result\" | jq -e '.success' > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n    local claimed_by\n    claimed_by=$(echo \"$result\" | jq -r '.claimed_by // \"unknown\"')\n    echo \"ERROR: Issue #$issue_num already claimed by $claimed_by\"\n    return 1\n  fi\n\n  return 0\n}\n```\n\n关键行为变更：当 `_backend_available` 检查失败（配置的后端不可达）时，claim 会被阻止并显示错误。当根本没有后端配置时，claim 绕过后端（单 Agent 模式）。\n\n无需更改技能 003-5 到 003-9。它们已经调用了 `update_issue_status()`，该函数静默地忽略失败。注释 `# (降级静默)` 已经记录了这一点。它们唯一可以做的增强是添加一个可选的调试日志，但这并非必需。\n\n---\n\n#### 阶段 3：更新钩子以实现统一降级\n\n**文件：** `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\hooks\\29-session-end\\base.sh`\n\n`release_session_issues()` 函数（第 14-33 行）目前内联了自己的 URL 加载逻辑。将其更改为使用 `backend.sh` 的函数：\n\n```\nrelease_session_issues() {\n  local sid\n  sid=$(json_get '.session_id')\n  [ -z \"$sid\" ] && return 0\n\n  # Source backend.sh for unified URL loading\n  source \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/backend.sh\"\n\n  _load_backend_url\n  [ -z \"$BACKEND_URL\" ] && return 0\n\n  # Health check -- if backend is down, silently skip\n  if ! _backend_available; then\n    log \"INFO\" \"Backend unreachable, skipping session release for $sid\"\n    return 0\n  fi\n\n  local result\n  result=$(curl -s --max-time 5 -X POST \"$BACKEND_URL/api/issue/release-session\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$sid\\\"}\" 2>/dev/null) || return 0\n\n  local count\n  count=$(echo \"$result\" | jq -r '.count // 0' 2>/dev/null)\n  [ \"$count\" -gt 0 ] && log \"INFO\" \"Released $count issues for session $sid\"\n}\n```\n\n这确保了：\n- 使用相同的 `_load_backend_url()`（带有格式错误的配置处理）\n- 使用相同的 `_backend_available()` 健康检查\n- 对所有失败进行静默降级\n\n---\n\n#### 阶段 4：Go 后端降级测试\n\n**文件：** `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\tests\\backend\\degradation_test.go` (新建)\n\n此文件测试后端被停止和启动时的系统行为。这些测试验证在 `httptest.Server` 关闭后，操作会优雅地失败，并且状态在恢复后保持一致。\n\n```\npackage backend_test\n```\n\n**测试用例 T12：后端在操作期间关闭**\n\n```\nfunc TestDegradation_BackendShutdown(t *testing.T) {\n  t.Run(\"claim_after_server_close_returns_connection_error\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"status_update_after_server_close_silent_failure\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"check_after_server_close_connection_error\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"release_session_after_server_close_connection_error\", ...)\n}\n```\n\n策略：使用 `httptest.NewServer`，获取其 URL，然后调用 `srv.Close()`。然后尝试使用旧 URL 进行 HTTP 调用。这些测试验证客户端行为（这与 shell 端测试相匹配）。由于 Go 测试是服务器端测试，这更准确地测试“后端重启后状态保持一致”。\n\n**测试用例 T13：后端恢复后状态一致性**\n\n```\nfunc TestDegradation_RecoveryConsistency(t *testing.T) {\n  t.Run(\"state_preserved_across_restart\", func(t *testing.T) {\n    // Setup: create a store with a real SQLite file\n    // 1. Seed data: #10 claimed by sess_a\n    // 2. Close the server\n    // 3. Create a NEW server using the SAME database file\n    // 4. Verify #10 is still claimed by sess_a\n    // 5. Verify claim by sess_b fails (still claimed)\n  })\n  t.Run(\"operations_during_downtime_have_no_side_effects\", ...)\n}\n```\n\n**测试用例 T14：格式错误的请求处理（服务器端健壮性）**\n\n```\nfunc TestDegradation_MalformedRequests(t *testing.T) {\n  t.Run(\"extremely_long_issue_number\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"unicode_in_session_id\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"negative_issue_number\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"empty_strings_in_required_fields\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"extra_unexpected_fields_ignored\", ...)\n  t.Run(\"null_values_in_required_fields\", ...)\n}\n```\n\n这些已经部分被现有测试覆盖（`TestCheckIssues_InvalidJSON` 等），但上面列出的特定边缘情况并未涵盖。\n\n---\n\n#### 阶段 5：Shell 端集成测试脚本\n\n**文件：** `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\tests\\shell\\degradation_test.sh` (新建)\n\n这是一个 bash 测试脚本，用于验证从 shell 脚本角度的完整降级行为。它需要：\n- 一个正在运行的 Go 后端（由脚本或 CI 启动）\n- `jq` 工具\n- `curl` 工具\n\n**结构：**\n\n```\n#!/bin/bash\n# Shell-side degradation tests for backend integration\n# Usage: bash degradation_test.sh [BACKEND_URL]\n# If BACKEND_URL is not provided, starts a temporary backend.\n\nset -euo pipefail\n```\n\n**测试函数：**\n\n```\n# Helper: create a temporary backend.conf\nsetup_conf() { ... }\n# Helper: remove temporary backend.conf\nteardown_conf() { ... }\n# Helper: create a malformed backend.conf\ncreate_malformed_conf() { ... }\n\ntest_T01_no_backend_conf_all_skills_work() {\n  # Remove backend.conf\n  # Source backend.sh\n  # Verify _load_backend_url returns 1\n  # Verify _backend_available returns false\n  # Verify update_issue_status silently returns 0\n}\n\ntest_T02_backend_up_claim_works() {\n  # Start backend, write backend.conf\n  # Verify _backend_available returns true\n  # Seed an issue via API\n  # Call claim via _call_backend -- verify success\n}\n\ntest_T03_backend_down_claim_blocked() {\n  # Write backend.conf pointing to real URL\n  # Stop backend\n  # Verify _require_backend returns 1\n  # Verify claim_issue_backend returns error\n}\n\ntest_T04_backend_down_status_silent() {\n  # Write backend.conf, backend down\n  # Call update_issue_status -- must return 0 (silent)\n  # Verify no stdout output (no error messages)\n}\n\ntest_T05_backend_down_release_session_silent() {\n  # Write backend.conf, backend down\n  # Simulate release_session_issues -- must return 0\n}\n\ntest_T06_backend_down_check_fallback() {\n  # Write backend.conf, backend down\n  # Call filter_claimed_issues with some JSON\n  # Verify it returns the full original list (no filtering)\n}\n\ntest_T07_malformed_conf_no_crash() {\n  # Various malformed configs:\n  # - BACKEND_URL= (empty)\n  # - BACKEND_URL=not-a-url\n  # - Binary data\n  # - Multiple BACKEND_URL lines\n  # - BACKEND_URL with spaces\n  # For each: source backend.sh, verify no crash, _load_backend_url returns 1\n}\n\ntest_T08_malformed_conf_skills_run() {\n  # With malformed backend.conf\n  # Source 003-5 scripts\n  # Verify update_issue_status returns 0 without error\n}\n\ntest_T09_backend_recovery_no_conflict() {\n  # 1. Start backend, claim #10\n  # 2. Stop backend\n  # 3. (Simulated degraded period -- no claim operations)\n  # 4. Start backend again with same DB\n  # 5. Verify #10 still claimed\n  # 6. Verify claim by different session fails\n  # 7. Release, verify re-claim works\n}\n```\n\n**运行器：**\n\n```\n# Main\nTOTAL=0\nPASS=0\nFAIL=0\n\nfor test_func in $(declare -F | grep '^declare -f test_' | awk '{print $3}'); do\n  TOTAL=$((TOTAL + 1))\n  echo \"Running: $test_func\"\n  if $test_func; then\n    PASS=$((PASS + 1))\n    echo \"  PASS\"\n  else\n    FAIL=$((FAIL + 1))\n    echo \"  FAIL\"\n  fi\ndone\n\necho \"\"\necho \"Results: $PASS/$TOTAL passed, $FAIL failed\"\n[ $FAIL -eq 0 ] || exit 1\n```\n\n---\n\n#### 阶段 6：验证和执行顺序\n\n实施顺序应为：\n\n1.  **阶段 1** (`backend.sh` 增强) -- 基础；其他所有都依赖于此\n2.  **阶段 2** (`003-4-issue-claim` 更新) -- 依赖于阶段 1\n3.  **阶段 3** (`29-session-end` 更新) -- 依赖于阶段 1\n4.  **阶段 4** (Go 降级测试) -- 独立于阶段 2-3，可以并行运行\n5.  **阶段 5** (Shell 降级测试) -- 依赖于阶段 1-3\n\n**验证清单：**\n\n- [ ] `_load_backend_url()` 拒绝格式错误的 URL（单元测试通过 shell 测试）\n- [ ] `_require_backend()` 在后端不可达时返回 1（单元测试）\n- [ ] `claim_issue_backend()` 在后端不可达时阻止 claim（集成测试）\n- [ ] `claim_issue_backend()` 在根本没有配置后端时允许 claim（集成测试）\n- [ ] `update_issue_status()` 在后端宕机时静默返回 0（集成测试）\n- [ ] `release_session_issues()` 在后端宕机时静默返回 0（集成测试）\n- [ ] `filter_claimed_issues()` 在后端宕机时返回完整列表（集成测试）\n- [ ] 格式错误的 `backend.conf` 不会导致任何技能崩溃（集成测试）\n- [ ] Go 服务器重启后状态保持不变（Go 测试）\n- [ ] 降级期间的所有操作不会与恢复后的状态冲突（Go + shell 测试）\n\n---\n\n### 关键实施文件\n\n- `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\backend.sh` -- 核心降级基础设施：添加 `_require_backend()`，加固 `_load_backend_url()` 以应对格式错误的配置\n- `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-4-issue-claim\\scripts\\03UserPromptSubmit.sh` -- 必须更新 `claim_issue_backend()` 以在配置的后端不可达时阻止 claim\n- `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\hooks\\29-session-end\\base.sh` -- 重构 `release_session_issues()` 以使用 `backend.sh` 并进行适当的健康检查\n- `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\tests\\backend\\degradation_test.go` -- 新文件：涵盖 T12/T13/T14 场景的 Go 后端降级测试\n- `D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\tests\\shell\\degradation_test.sh` -- 新文件：验证完整降级行为的 Shell 端集成测试","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}
