[2026-05-29 22:06:15] [INFO] [Stop] Input: {"session_id":"05f8cfed-d555-49d3-9c73-101e07a3c913","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\d--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\05f8cfed-d555-49d3-9c73-101e07a3c913.jsonl","cwd":"d:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"Stop","stop_hook_active":false,"last_assistant_message":"这段就是整个程序的**命令路由器**，逻辑很简单：\n\n```go\nos.Args 的结构：\nos.Args[0] = \"claude-tap-plus\"    // 程序名\nos.Args[1] = \"backend\"            // 子命令\nos.Args[2:] = [\"--port\", \"8080\"]  // 子命令的参数\n```\n\n流程：\n\n```\n用户输入命令\n    ↓\n有第二个参数吗？(os.Args[1])\n    ├── session-push  → runSessionPush()   会话推送\n    ├── session-pull  → runSessionPull()   会话拉取\n    ├── session-status→ runSessionStatus() 会话状态\n    ├── backend       → runBackend()       启动后端服务\n    ├── help/--help/-h→ printUsage()       打印帮助\n    └── 其他 / 没有      → runProxy()       默认走代理模式\n```\n\n举例：\n\n```bash\nclaude-tap-plus backend --port 8080\n# os.Args = [\"claude-tap-plus\", \"backend\", \"--port\", \"8080\"]\n# 匹配 case \"backend\" → 调用 runBackend([\"--port\", \"8080\"])\n\nclaude-tap-plus session-push\n# os.Args = [\"claude-tap-plus\", \"session-push\"]\n# 匹配 case \"session-push\" → 调用 runSessionPush([])\n\nclaude-tap-plus --upstream https://xxx\n# os.Args = [\"claude-tap-plus\", \"--upstream\", \"https://xxx\"]\n# 不匹配任何 case → 调用 runProxy([\"--upstream\", \"https://xxx\"])\n\nclaude-tap-plus\n# os.Args = [\"claude-tap-plus\"]\n# len(os.Args) = 1，不进入 if → 调用 runProxy([])\n```\n\n关键点：`os.Args[2:]` 把子命令后面的参数切片传给对应的函数，所以 `runBackend` 收到的 `args` 不包含 `backend` 本身，只有 `--port 8080` 这些。","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}
