roject}/{date}_{time}_{shortID}.jsonl`，缺少 machine_id 和 project_slug 层级，多机器多项目场景下 trace 文件无法隔离。需要重构为四层目录结构：`.claude-tap-plus/.traces/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`。"," ","-1. `_load_backend_url()` 不校验 URL 格式，malformed backend.conf 可能导致 curl 异常","-2. `claim_issue_backend()` 不检查后端可用性就直接调用 API，后端宕机时 claim 静默通过（安全漏洞）","-3. `29-session-end` hook 内联了 URL 加载逻辑，没有复用 `backend.sh`","-4. 所有后端调用失败时无任何日志，调试不可见","-5. 没有降级场景的测试覆盖","+## 当前实现"," ","-## 修改方案","+**`trace/writer.go` 关键函数：**","+- `DefaultTraceDir()` → 可执行文件同级的 `.traces` 目录","+- `DetectProjectName()` → git remote repo name 或 cwd basename","+- `NewTracePath(baseDir)` → `baseDir/{project}/{date}_{time}_{hex}.jsonl`","+- `NewTraceWriter(path)` → 创建目录并打开文件","+- `TraceWriter.Write(record)` → 写入 JSONL 记录（record 中含 session_id）"," ","-### Step 1: 增强 `backend.sh` 统一降级基础设施","+**`proxy/reverse.go` 关键函数：**","+- `extractSessionID(reqBody)` → 从 `metadata.user_id` JSON 字符串中提取 session_id","+- `buildRecord()` → 构建含 session_id 的 trace 记录","+- 代理启动时创建一个 TraceWriter，所有请求写入同一文件"," ","-**文件:** `.claude/skills/backend.sh`","+**`cmd/claude-tap/main.go` 启动流程：**","+1. `trace.NewTracePath(tapOutputDir)` → 生成路径","+2. `trace.NewTraceWriter(tracePath)` → 打开文件","+3. `proxy.NewReverseProxy(target, writer)` → 代理使用 writer","+4. 代理生命周期内所有请求追加到同一文件"," ","-修改内容：","-- `_load_backend_url()` — 增加 URL 格式校验（必须 `http://` 或 `https://` 开头，不含空白字符），invalid 时记录 warn 日志并 return 1","-- 新增 `_require_backend()` — 区分三种状态：未配置(return 2)、已配置但不可达(return 1)、可用(return 0)；不可达时记录 ERROR 日志","-- `_call_backend()` — 失败时增加 DEBUG 级别日志（通过 `skill_log`，需 SKILL_TAG 已设置）","-- `update_issue_status()` — 保持 `return 0` 静默降级不变","+## 目标路径"," ","-### Step 2: 改造 003-4-issue-claim 的 claim 降级","+```","+.claude-tap-plus/.traces/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl","+```"," ","-**文件:** `.claude/skills/003-4-issue-claim/scripts/03UserPromptSubmit.sh`","+示例：`.claude-tap-plus/.traces/Administrator@DESKTOP-ABC123/D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk/bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d