l`\n5. 后续 API 请求都写入这个文件\n\n## 改动文件\n\n### 1. `claude_tap_plus/internal/trace/writer.go`\n\n**新增函数：**\n- `MachineID() string` — 返回 `username@hostname`（用 `os.User.Username()` + `os.Hostname()`）\n- `ExtractProjectSlug(transcriptPath string) string` — 从 transcript_path 提取 project_slug，无效时 fallback 到 `DetectProjectName()`\n\n**修改 `DefaultTraceDir()`：** 改为 `$HOME/.claude-tap-plus/.traces`（与数据库设计文档一致）\n\n```go\nfunc DefaultTraceDir() string {\n    home, err := os.UserHomeDir()\n    if err != nil {\n        return \".claude-tap-plus/.traces\"\n    }\n    return filepath.Join(home, \".claude-tap-plus\", \".traces\")\n}\n```\n\n**保留 `NewTracePath()` 不变**（向后兼容），新增 `NewSessionTracePath()`：\n```go\nfunc NewSessionTracePath(baseDir, machineID, projectSlug, sessionID string) string\n```\n\n### 2. `claude_tap_plus/internal/proxy/reverse.go`\n\n**新增内部端点处理：**\n- `ReverseProxy` 增加 `baseDir` 字段\n- 构造函数改为接收 `baseDir` 参数（不再接收 `*TraceWriter`）\n- `Start()` 中在 mux 上注册 `/_internal/trace-init`\n- 收到 trace-init 请求后：解析 JSON → 调用 `NewSessionTracePath()` → `NewTraceWriter()` → 保存 writer\n- 后续 API 请求写入这个 writer\n- session_id 为空时（trace-init 未调用前），用 `NewTracePath()` 创建临时文件兜底\n\n**内部端点请求/响应：**\n```\nPOST /_internal/trace-init\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"bf15cac4-...\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"Administrator@DESKTOP-ABC123\",\n  \"project_slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",\n  \"transcript_path\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\...\\\\.claude\\\\projects\\\\D--xxx\\\\uuid.jsonl\"\n}\n\n→ 200 {\"status\":\"ok\",\"trace_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\...\\\\.claude-tap-plus\\\\.traces\\\\...\\\\uuid.jsonl\"}\n```\n\n### 3. `claude_tap_plus/internal/proxy/paths.go`\n\n在 `IsAllowedPath` 中放行 `/_internal/` 前缀的路径（或在 serveHTTP 中优先处理内部端点，不走 whitelist）。\n\n### 4. `claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/main.go`\n\n适配新的 proxy 构造方式：\n```go\n// 旧\nwriter, _ := trace.NewTraceWriter(tracePath)\nrp := proxy.NewReverseProxy(target, writer)\n\n// 新\nrp := proxy.NewReverseProxy(target, tapOutputDir)\n```\n\n退出汇总：调用 `rp.Summary()` 替代 `writer.Summary()`。\n\n### 5. `.claude/hooks/01-session-start/base.sh`\n\n在现有逻辑中新增 trace 初始化调用：\n\n```bash\ninit_trace_path() {\n  local proxy_url=\"$ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL\"\n  [ -z \"$proxy_url\" ] && return 0\n\n  local sid\n  sid=$(json_get '.session_id')\n  [ -z \"$sid\" ] && return 0\n\n  local machine_id\n  machine_id=\"$(whoami 2>/dev/null || echo unknown)@$(hostname 2>/dev/null || echo unknown)\"\n\n  local transcript_path\n  transcript_path=$(json_get '.transcript_path')\n\n  local project_slug\n  # 从 transcript_path 提取 project_slug（复用已有逻辑）\n  project_slug=$(echo \"$transcript_path\" | sed -n 's/.*\\.claude[\\\\/]\\{1\\}projects[\\\\/]\\{1\\}\\([^\\\\/]*\\).*/\\1/p')\n  [ -z \"$project_slug\" ] && project_slug=$(basename \"$(json_get '.cwd')\" 2>/dev/null)\n\n  curl -s --max-time 3 -X POST \"$proxy_url/_internal/trace-init\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\n      \\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$sid\\\",\n      \\\"machine_id\\\":\\\"$machine_id\\\",\n      \\\"project_slug\\\":\\\"$project_slug\\\",\n      \\\"transcript_path\\\":\\\"$transcript_path\\\"\n    }\" > /dev/null 2>&1\n}\n\ninit_trace_path\n```\n\n### 6. 测试 `claude_tap_plus/tests/trace/writer_test.go`\n\n新增测试：\n- `TestMachineID` — 格式为 `username@hostname`，非空\n- `TestExtractProjectSlug` — Windows/Linux 路径提取正确\n- `TestNewSessionTracePath` — 路径格式 `baseDir/machine/project/session.jsonl`\n- `TestDefaultTraceDir` — 返回 `$HOME/.claude-tap-plus/.traces`\n\n## 不修改的部分\n\n- `TraceWriter.Write()` — 写入逻辑和 JSONL 格式不变\n- `TraceWriter.updateStats()` — 统计逻辑不变\n- `buildRecord()` / `extractSessionID()` — record 构建不变\n- SSE 处理逻辑不变\n\n## 验证步骤\n\n1. `go test ./internal/trace/ -v && go test ./tests/trace/ -v` — 单元测试\n2. `go test ./...` — 全量无回归\n3. `go run ./cmd/claude-tap --tap-verbose -- claude` — 手动验证：\n   - SessionStart hook 触发后 trace 文件出现在 `$HOME/.claude-tap-plus/.traces/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`\n   - API 流量记录到该文件\n   - 不通过代理启动时无影响\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":77,"newStart":2,"newLines":30,"lines":[" "," ## Context"," ","-当前 trace 文件路径为 `{baseDir}/{project}/{date}_{time}_{shortID}.jsonl`，缺少 machine_id 和 project_slug 层级，多机器多项目场景下 trace 文件无法隔离。需要重构为四层目录结构：`.claude-tap-plus/.traces/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`。","+当前 trace 文件路径为 `{baseDir}/{project}/{date}_{time}_{shortID}.jsonl`，缺少 machine_id 和 project_slug 层级。需重构为 `.claude-tap-plus/.traces/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`。"," ","-## 当前实现","+## 核心设计：SessionStart hook 通过 HTTP 告知代理 trace 路径"," ","-**`trace/writer.go` 关键函数：**","-- `DefaultTraceDir()` → 可执行文件同级的 `.traces` 目录","-- `DetectProjectName()` → git remote repo name 或 cwd basename","-- `NewTracePath(baseDir)` → `baseDir/{project}/{date}_{time}_{hex}.jsonl`","-- `NewTraceWriter(path)` → 创建目录并打开文件","-- `TraceWriter.Write(record)` → 写入 JSONL 记录（record 中含 session_id）","+代理本身是 HTTP 服务器，加一个内部端点。SessionStart hook 通过 curl 把 session 信息传给代理。"," ","-**`proxy/reverse.go` 关键函数：**","-- `extractSessionID(reqBody)` → 从 `metadata.user_id` JSON 字符串中提取 session_id","-- `buildRecord()` → 构建含 session_id 的 trace 记录","-- 代理启动时创建一个 TraceWriter，所有请求写入同一文件","+**时序：**","+1. 代理启动 → HTTP server 增加 `POST /_internal/trace-init` 端点 → 启动 Claude Code","+2. Claude Code 触发 SessionStart hook → 拿到 session_id, transcript_path, cwd","+3. Hook curl 调用 `POST $ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL/_internal/trace-init`，传 `{session_id, machine_id, project_slug}`","+4. 代理收到 → 创建 `{baseDir}/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`","+5. 后续 API 请求都写入这个文件"," ","-**`cmd/claude-tap/main.go` 启动流程：**","-1. `trace.NewTracePath(tapOutputDir)` → 生成路径","-2. `trace.NewTraceWriter(tracePath)` → 打开文件","-3. `proxy.NewReverseProxy(target, writer)` → 代理使用 writer","-4. 代理生命周期内所有请求追加到同一文件","+## 改动文件"," ","-## 目标路径","+### 1. `claude_tap_plus/internal/trace/writer.go`"," ","-```","-.claude-tap-plus/.traces/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl","-```","+**新增函数：**","+- `MachineID() string` — 返回 `username@hostname`（用 `os.User