` | 否 | — |\n43\t| 003-3-issue-discuss | `gh issue view`, `gh issue comment` | 否 | — |\n44\t| 003-4-issue-claim | `gh issue list` → `gh issue edit --add-assignee` | **是** | list 后去重，edit 前原子领取 |\n45\t| 003-5-issue-fix | `gh issue view` → `git checkout -b` → `gh issue comment` | **是** | 标记 fixing 状态 |\n46\t| 003-6-issue-done | `git status` → `gh issue edit` (改 label) | **是** | 标记 ready-for-pr 状态 |\n47\t| 003-7-issue-pr | `gh pr create` | **是** | 标记 pr-created 状态 |\n48\t| 003-8-issue-test | `gh pr view` → 测试 → `gh pr edit` | **是** | 标记 testing 状态 |\n49\t| 003-9-issue-review | `gh pr merge` / `gh issue edit` | **是** | 标记 merged/rejected 状态 |\n50\t\n51\t## 各技能脚本中已有的数据源\n52\t\n53\t各技能脚本在运行时已可获取以下数据，无需额外参数传递：\n54\t\n55\t```bash\n56\t# 项目信息\n57\trepo_full_name=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq '.nameWithOwner')\n58\t# → xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk\n59\t\n60\t# Issue 信息\n61\tissue_number=$(echo \"$PROMPT\" | grep -oE '#[0-9]+' | head -1 | tr -d '#')\n62\t# → 10\n63\t\n64\tissue_title=$(gh issue view \"$issue_number\" --json title --jq '.title')\n65\t# → \"优化 issue 模板\"\n66\t\n67\t# Session 信息（从 hook 环境或请求体）\n68\tsession_id=$(json_get '.session_id')\n69\t# → bf15cac4-7235-48ce-8853-5d4598547f31\n70\t\n71\t# 后端地址\n72\tbackend_url=$(cat \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/backend.conf\" 2>/dev/null | grep '^BACKEND_URL=' | cut -d= -f2)\n73\t```\n74\t\n75\t## 各技能需要传入后端的数据汇总\n76\t\n77\t| 技能 | repo_full_name | issue_number | issue_title | session_id | status |\n78\t|------|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|------|\n79\t| D1: 003-4-issue-claim | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | — (claim API 自处理) |\n80\t| D2: 003-5-issue-fix | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `fixing` |\n81\t| D3: 003-6-issue-done | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `ready-for-pr` |\n82\t| D4: 003-7-issue-pr | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `pr-created` |\n83\t| D5: 003-8-issue-test | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `testing` |\n84\t| D6: 003-9-issue-review | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | `reviewing` → `merged` / `rejected` |\n85\t| D7: SessionEnd | — | — | — | ✓ | — (release-session API 自处理) |\n86\t\n87\t## 整体架构\n88\t\n89\t```\n90\t